bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#6699CC][b]🚀 Quick Start[/b][/color]

[color=#99CCFF]1. Authenticate:[/color]
   • Preferred: Launch your game from the [color=#66AAFF]itch.io app[/color] — it provides a secure launcher token automatically.
   • Or: Configure OAuth in Project Settings (Client ID, Scope, Redirect URI), then use the [b]OAuth Login[/b] button on the right to sign in.

[color=#99CCFF]2. Configure settings:[/color]
   • Enter your [b]Game ID[/b] on the right (numeric ID from your game's URL)
   • Optionally enable [b]Debug logging[/b] for troubleshooting

[color=#99CCFF]3. Save and integrate:[/color]
   • Click \"Save Settings\" to persist configuration
   • Use the plugin APIs in your game code

[color=#6699CC][b]💻 Code Integration[/b][/color]

[color=#AAAAAA]Basic usage in your scripts:[/color]
[code]
extends Control

func _ready():
    # Initialize and connect signals
    Itch.initialize_with_scene(self)
    Itch.verify_purchase_result.connect(_on_verify_result)

    # Verify a download key
    Itch.verify_download_key(\"user_download_key_here\")

func _on_verify_result(verified: bool, data: Dictionary):
    if verified:
        print(\"Access granted\")
    else:
        print(\"Access denied\")
[/code]

[color=#6699CC][b]🔧 Input Formats Supported[/b][/color]

[color=#CCCCCC]The plugin accepts multiple formats:[/color]
• Raw download key: [color=#99FF99]abc123def456...[/color]
• Full itch URL: [color=#99FF99]https://user.itch.io/game/download/123?key=...[/color]
• Download URL: [color=#99FF99]https://itch.io/game-download/?key=...[/color]

[color=#6699CC][b]⚙️ Configuration Options[/b][/color]

[color=#FFCC99]OAuth/Launcher Token:[/color] Automatically provided by itch app or via OAuth login
[color=#FFCC99]Game ID:[/color] Numeric identifier for your specific game
[color=#FFCC99]Debug Logging:[/color] Enable detailed console output for troubleshooting

[color=#6699CC][b]🛡️ Security Notes[/b][/color]

• No API keys are used — only short-lived tokens
• Tokens are sent via HTTPS Authorization: Bearer headers
• Never commit secrets to your repository

[color=#6699CC][b]📋 Troubleshooting[/b][/color]

[color=#FF9999]Common issues and solutions:[/color]
• [color=#CCCCCC]Plugin not found:[/color] Enable in Project > Plugins, restart Godot
• [color=#CCCCCC]Missing token:[/color] Launch from itch app or sign in via OAuth
• [color=#CCCCCC]Invalid download key:[/color] Check the key or try a different account
• [color=#CCCCCC]Network issues:[/color] Enable debug logging for detailed errors

[color=#99CCFF]For more help, check the README.md file in the plugin directory.[/color]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

